{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168120/extras/1dff99b5b6f04ac863f8525579b251f2.avif?t=1768384523\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a software developer, you've created a software that provides correct answers to all questions. Now, you want to test this invention by solving the city's biggest mystery. But seeking the absolute truth in the enigmatic realm of zeros and ones comes with a price. Your choices may steer you toward either inner peace or inner chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168120/extras/492fa6053d906e99fd9827051a354a2f.avif?t=1768384523\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Development:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character's physical and mental abilities throughout the story to help them overcome real and fantastical challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dialogue Choices:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the story and your character through interactive dialogue options. Enjoy an engaging and intriguing storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Journey into Memories:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your character's past and uncover memories by delving into gray and dark areas. Benefit from remembering buried events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Software Interface:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the country's greatest mystery using powerful computer software. Uncover truths while navigating corporate intrigues and everyday challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action-Runner Mechanics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face demons and monsters in your nightmares, experiencing fast-paced action scenes and feeling the power of the katana.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2168120?t=1768384523","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768384523","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168120/c8c9b6b5db01ce9f8c72c1e01349b52cf1851523/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768384523","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168120/c8c9b6b5db01ce9f8c72c1e01349b52cf1851523/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768384523","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2680430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168120/extras/1dff99b5b6f04ac863f8525579b251f2.avif?t=1768384523\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a software developer, you've created a software that provides correct answers to all questions. Now, you want to test this invention by solving the city's biggest mystery. But seeking the absolute truth in the enigmatic realm of zeros and ones comes with a price. Your choices may steer you toward either inner peace or inner chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168120/extras/492fa6053d906e99fd9827051a354a2f.av